 identità tra i due gatti è pressoché annunciato e il film fa ampio uso di tutti quegli elementi già utilizzati in abbondanza nelle cosiddette commedie degli equivoci, con un finale dichiarato: l'alleanza tra il rozzo felino americano e il principino inglese, la ribellione degli animali e la rivincita di Odie.","tagline":"A volte 4 zampe non bastano... ne servono 8."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Jon and Garfield visit the United Kingdom, where a case of mistaken cat identity finds Garfield ruling over a castle. His reign is soon jeopardized by the nefarious Lord Dargis, who has designs on the estate.","tagline":"2 much of a good thing is even better."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxyZXmeL9XUBW2hsqKRKI48L0Ki.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lrUeu7XMNaKJn6v8ps0DHqUE11L.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":9513,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxyZXmeL9XUBW2hsqKRKI48L0Ki.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yxyZXmeL9XUBW2hsqKRKI48L0Ki.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1714},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxyZXmeL9XUBW2hsqKRKI48L0Ki.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yxyZXmeL9XUBW2hsqKRKI48L0Ki.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1714},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ehnUPxnZ1dPkBe0NywyHqewR0z4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ehnUPxnZ1dPkBe0NywyHqewR0z4.jpg","language":"it","width":1600,"height":2400}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/O2j1bwErQ6bbBVZM5Vxg3Tsoir.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/O2j1bwErQ6bbBVZM5Vxg3Tsoir.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidat